{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46250","headline":"溪寺水阁闲眺因寄宋使君 · 贯休","name":"溪寺水阁闲眺因寄宋使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪木萧条一凭阑，玉霜飞後浪花寒。\n钓鱼船上风烟暝，古木林中砧杵乾。\n至竟道心方始是，空耽山色亦无端。\n谁如太守分忧外，时把西经尽日看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}